OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive and happier
OL,9,Fmoments happening across the West
OL,10,FMidlands - and we want to celebrate and
OL,11,Fshare them.
OL,13,FThis week, we've heard how fast food
OL,14,Fstaff were left shocked when a pony
OL,15,Fturned up at a McDonald's drive-thru.
OL,17,FWe've also learnt about efforts at a
OL,18,Freservoir to help the humble willow
OL,19,Ftit, and how a father and daughter
OL,20,Fturned a small community food project
OL,21,Finto an operation helping thousands of
OL,22,Fpeople every week.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
